<title>USA: Work Recovery restructures operations.</title>
<headline>Work Recovery restructures operations.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Work Recovery Inc on Thursday said it is restructuring its operations to better focus upon sales and marketing of its ERGOS technology.</p>
<p>ERGOS is its functional capacity evaluation technology which evaluates an individual's capacity to perform work.</p>
<p>Work Recovery said it will hire Functional Capacities Evaluation Technologies Inc to assist in the marketing and sales of the ERGOS system.</p>
</text>
